        "category": "plugin",
        "severity": "error",
        "description": "Do not convert malformed boolean input to absence. This Match returns null for non-booleans, so callers cannot distinguish an invalid flag from an omitted one. Decode the optional boolean with Schema and use the decoded value in the service operation.",
